    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawuti'iimár Rehoboamu /uuru nguwa sleér, inós nee mukós sleémeero dabér AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngina mayé' ilaiwa/amero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inooín niwa inkihhimu wasleesiyé' dír AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, qoomár kurkú kooán oo waawuti'iimár Rehoboamuwo, Shishaki, waawutmoó Misri, gixsár Yerusalemu gay i haratláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaardu ngi kon a kumuú wák nee tsiire tsár, nee múk faras gwaa i tsa/an a kume mibeeri lahhoó'. Slaqwaruuse ka yaariir, faarooro ka aleeslayká, tidá' yaamaá Misrír daahh dinkwa nee inós: Múk Libya, nee oo Suki, nee oo Kushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsaduudá' koo/i gawden awa Yuda giri hayóh iri hardáh ay Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy aarusmo Shemaya waawutmo Rehoboamu nee geeraharuusér Yudawo gina i daqáy, kudá' naa burumburiitiye' Yerusalemu as tawa goów Shishaki wa ale, giri báy, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, ‹Kuungá' aníng iga geexeeré', ala gawaá adoorihe aníng kuungá' naa geexáw, nee nuri haniís dír waawutmo Shishaki.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy ala waawutmo nee geeraharuusér Israeliwo tiri niinaweesiyé', tari oó', «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ adór ganaa' gaa tleéhh.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngiwa ár adór mukdá' inooín tira niinaweesiyé', Shemaya axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gari axaás i kat, «Inooín taa niinaweesiyé', i hhaamisaaká, alaá deelór niinawe i tuú/. Gixsár Yerusalemu a qwaareesaaká ar buhhtaeé' ar loohír waawutmo Shishaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inooín ngu sagadiyusiyá', as kahhó' kawa tsaahhi adór aníng tir sagadiyuusi tar dimbé nee waawutuú baraakaá yaamuwo kuwa sagadiyuusi.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmo Shishaki gixsár Yerusalemu gari i haratláy, xosluudá' taa baraá Doó Mungú i baáts, nee doó waawutmowo gari ar tláy, nee umuú gaaro, nee gaambuudá' ta tleéhh ar sahaábu nee waawutmo Solomon sleéme giri ar tláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitángw gaambór sahaábuwo waawutmo Rehoboamu gambu giri tleéhh ar muqslír sirdaa/aat, nee giri haniís dír xuumuusér afkú doó waawutmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú daqto qoomár waawutmo bir baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ káy, xuumuuse gambu gin aluuwós wa gagát, aluuwo ngiri ki/isiyá' amór doó xuuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As adoodá' inós tiwa niinaweés, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ mune gay guú/, Mungú gwaa ak hhaamisiiká. Tam adoorihe yaamaá Yuda nay hhooayé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Rehoboamu /uuru guri sláy baraá Yerusalemu nee iri waawuti'i'ín. Qoomár waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún, kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsiyáhh nee wak. Inós kureeri ngaa /aáy mibaá nee faanqw baraá waawuti'iimár Yerusalemuro, gixsadá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tsawaár baraá gixsadaá Israeli sleémeero as inós kuwa baraadá' wa sluufmiisi. Aayór Rehoboamu a Na'ama, tidár xoorór Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu tlakweema gina tleéhh, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gwaa leelehhiiká ar muunuuwós sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá waawutmo Rehoboamu iimír iimu/úngw wa tleemu ay alhhe'eesaay kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú iinslaaslángw aarusmo Shemaya, nee baraá kitaábuú iinslaaslángw tlahhi'i oo iigu'utusmo Ido. Qooma sleémeero slaqwara i daadeer tla/ángw waawutmo Rehoboamu nee Yeroboamuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Rehoboamu iri gwaá' kway foól baraá gixsár Daudi, nee garmaawós Abiya kuri waawutmoó wa qaás kitaangós wa aleeró.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
